id: ops-retire-failed-publish-attempt
title: Allow operator retirement after failed npm publish attempts
description: A durable publish attempt blocks later release candidates even when npm never accepted the tarball. Recover through explicit operator retirement after a settled exact-version registry check confirms absence and GitHub has no tag or Release.
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[2]: "area:release","gh:unbraind/pm-ops#302"
created_at: "2026-11-19T02:44:22.140Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-19T03:26:13.246Z"
author: codex-sol
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-19T02:44:27.519Z",codex-sol,"Plan: read the candidate-bound publication journal before the live version check. Require the explicit operator flag, an absence check started after the latest recorded attempt plus the ten-minute npm visibility window, and no tag, Release or post-hook journal. Cover settled and unsettled attempts, present and unreadable registry responses, and unchanged no-attempt recovery. Run the linked tests and local typecheck, lint, duplication, docstring, full coverage and regenerated changelog gates."
  "2026-11-19T02:49:39.062Z",codex-sol,"The linked continuation and reference suite passed all 277 tests. Typecheck, lint, zero-duplication, docstring and changelog regeneration and drift checks passed. The live-read fixture also rejects an early request that returns after settlement and a successful HTTP response with an empty JSON body."
  "2026-11-19T03:06:26.357Z",codex-sol,"The first full suite had 1,989 passes, no failures and two opt-in real-repository skips. The branch gate identified one uncovered refusal for a truncated attempt-journal marker. Added an exact fixture and restarted the full coverage gate."
  "2026-11-19T03:26:11.134Z",codex-sol,"Final linked continuation and reference suite passed 278 tests without skips. npm run coverage passed with 100% statements, branches, functions and lines across 50 source files, 1,990 passing tests and two opt-in real-repository skips. Typecheck, lint, duplication at 0%, docstring and changelog checks passed. Nearby release changes in pm-ops#295 and pm-ops#301 may require coordination when they land."
